{{ template "chart.description" . }}

A Helm Chart to deploy [unpoller](https://unpoller.com) - a Prometheus (and InfluxDB) exporter for UniFi Network controller metrics. Based on the upstream `ghcr.io/unpoller/unpoller` image.

